The images are NOT relicensed by this repository. Every image keeps the licence
declared by its original source, recorded per record in data/*.jsonl:

  * Wikimedia Commons files  -> the licence named in each record's "license"
    field (e.g. CC0, Public domain, CC BY 2.0/3.0/4.0, CC BY-SA 2.0/3.0/4.0),
    with the author in "attribution". Check the linked source_page before reuse.
